    "description": "Fountain, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 160 blocks vs 51 (9 x 9 with its paving instead of 5 x 5). Flush plaza piece (ground_layer 0: the paving and basin floor replace the grass, level with the lawn; the mod's builders can't do that yet). A round two-tier stone fountain: a basin 7 across with a rim one block tall, a stem and corbelled upper bowl, on a paved round 9 across with a cobble path in from each side; the basin water by the decoration step. L2 lantern posts with flowering bushes, flower beds in the grass corners, lily pads; L3 a statue top with a gold-look finial, flower pots on the rim, banners. Not yet builder-tested: allium, cornflower, dandelion, flowering_azalea_leaves, grass_block, oxeye_daisy, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: lily_pad, water.",
